		{
			dependencies: ["1BD3F090A3FA8B3C"]
			description: [
				"&eSource&r is Ars Nouveau's energy, stored in &eSource Jars&r and generated by &eSourcelinks&r. It is entirely separate from Forge Energy."
				""
				"&e&lThe sourcelinks and what they eat:&r"
				"&7- &fVolcanic&7 - burns items, like a furnace"
				"&7- &fAgronomic&7 - nearby crop growth"
				"&7- &fAlchemical&7 - potions"
				"&7- &fVitalic&7 - nearby mob damage and healing"
				"&7- &fMycelial&7 - mob deaths"
				""
				"&e&lAgronomic pairs beautifully with a Mystical Agriculture farm&r you are already running - the crops grow, and the growth itself generates Source for free."
				""
				"&c&lRituals and machines fail silently with no Source nearby.&r If something is not working, check the jar before anything else."
			]
			icon: "ars_nouveau:source_jar"
			id: "64B9091CDDD0F160"
			rewards: [{
				id: "4B4B4983235E9627"
