		{
			description: [
				"The &eImbuement Chamber&r is the entry-level Ars crafting block - it makes Source Gems, basic glyphs and the components for everything else."
				""
				"&7Drop the item in and provide Source. It pulls from nearby Source Jars automatically.&r"
				""
				"&8Faster with Sconces and Arcane Pedestals nearby. Build it before the Enchanting Apparatus - most of that recipe passes through here."
			]
			icon: "ars_nouveau:imbuement_chamber"
			id: "429A934F2E0C099C"
