		{
			description: [
				"Ars Nouveau automates with summoned creatures rather than machines."
				""
				"&e&lThe &fDrygmy&e is the standout for this pack.&r It collects drops from nearby mobs &lwithout killing them&r - so a pen of captured mobs produces their drops passively, with no grinder, no fall damage and no spawn platform."
				""
				"&7- &fWhirlisprig&7 - farms crops in a radius and puts them in a chest"
				"&7- &fWixie&7 - crafts items automatically from a supplied inventory"
				"&7- &fStarbuncle&7 - carries items between inventories"
				""
				"&e&lAll of them run on Source&r, and none of them need cables, GUIs or config. Place the charm, give them a home, and they work."
			]
			icon: "ars_nouveau:drygmy_charm"
			id: "4D14951234EB768C"
			rewards: [{
				id: "3300C2E2CAA86E2E"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 30
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Automation that walks around"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "6A21FE8BE5939178"
